flowchart TD
    U[User] --> UI[Secure Web Interface]
    UI --> API[Flask API]
    API --> MEM[In-Memory Password Analysis]
    MEM --> L[Length Analyzer]
    MEM --> C[Character Analyzer]
    MEM --> CP[Common Password Checker]
    MEM --> S[Sequence Detector]
    MEM --> K[Keyboard Pattern Detector]
    MEM --> R[Repetition Detector]
    MEM --> CTX[Optional Context Checker]
    MEM --> E[Entropy Estimator]
    L --> SCORE[Strength Scoring Engine]
    C --> SCORE
    CP --> SCORE
    S --> SCORE
    K --> SCORE
    R --> SCORE
    CTX --> SCORE
    E --> SCORE
    SCORE --> REC[Classification + Suggestions]
    REC --> UI
    SCORE --> META[Safe Aggregate Metadata]
    META --> DB[(SQLite Analytics)]
    DB --> DASH[Dashboard]
